    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you have identified that your organisation has a new procurement requirement (that cannot be met by reusing or recycling existing goods or services, or by using an existing contract), you should seek quotations from a minimum of three suppliers. These suppliers should have the experience and expertise to meet your requirements.",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Hints and Tips",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "T o receive three quotes back from suppliers, you may wish to approach four or five suppliers in case not all respond.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Potential supplier s may be identified by searching the register of suppliers on Public Contracts Scotland (PCS) . This website offe rs a 'Quick Quote' system to seek quotations from suppliers registered on the website.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If your Organisation does not use PC S, potential suppliers may be identified by other means e.g. using internet searches, trade publications or phone directories.",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If you are unable to identify three suppliers , you should then commence a Route 2 Procurement Exercise . If you need further information or guidance on this you should contact your local procureme nt team or Centre of Expertise .",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "You should try to not restrict your selection to existing suppl iers to your Organisation, but include new suppliers for ea ch procurement exercise This will:",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "facilitate competition",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "encourage innovation",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure best value in future service delivery",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "help suppliers, who have not previously bid for Scottish public sector work, to gain access to opportunities and gain experience working for the Scottish Public Sector.",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "A Non-Competitive Action",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "If only one supplier can undertake the work required, you should contact your local procurement team, senior management or your Centre of Expertise for advice. One possible option they may propose is to seek approval for a Non-Competitive Action (NCA) from your local procurement team or senior management. You should then follow the remainder of this process. For commercial reasons, you should not inform the supplier that they are the only supplier involved in the process.",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Note: A Non-Competitive Action is an exceptional procedure and should:",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "be strictly limited to certain situations",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "be approved from your Organisation’s senior management to proceed with this process",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00018",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "be documented and retained for audit purposes.",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00019",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Checklist",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00020",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Do You Have What You Need?",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action",
        "Do You Have What You Need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00021",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Before carrying on, please check you've got everything you need.",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action",
        "Do You Have What You Need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00022",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Please ensure that you:",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action",
        "Do You Have What You Need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00023",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "are registered on Public Contracts Scotland",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action",
        "Do You Have What You Need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00024",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "have received senior management approval",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action",
        "Do You Have What You Need?"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00025",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "documented all activities related to identifying suppliers for your procurement exercise.",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "heading_path": [
        "How to Identify Potential Suppliers",
        "A Non-Competitive Action",
